{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0333_1000_p", "source_sha256": "dd45d79a2fa072cc2efee025e01eebb4c016f6cbd9ec566fb00043b385628d12", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影だ。\nテーマは中華街めぐりだが……真美の調子はどうかな）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄写真杂志《爱格拉！！》。\n主题是逛中华街，不过……真美的状态怎么样呢）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0333_1001_012mam", "source_sha256": "76242a88abea02ba233e49ae62068c869af7f27c1e9943c8913427febc219e38", "ja": "おはようございまーす！　765プロから来ました\n双海真美でーっす！　よろしくお願いしまぁーっす☆", "zh": "早上好——！我是从765事务所来的  \n我是双海真美！请多关照——☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0333_1002_p", "source_sha256": "dcdf397d8be3f7d16dfb5b413b0af73aba6becf7d83001aee53c94610a7fa2ac", "ja": "……ん？　この声は真美……？\nけど、なんだか様子がおかしいな……。", "zh": "……嗯？这个声音是真美……？\n不过，总感觉样子有点奇怪啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0333_1003_012mam", "source_sha256": "9c4b33f5190639f1ee69da5bcbec4f045b77a4353e03572eae6da1d151d71625", "ja": "あ、兄ちゃ……じゃなかった{$P$}！\nおっはようございまぁーす☆", "zh": "啊，兄……不对，{$P$}！\n早上好——☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0333_1004_p", "source_sha256": "21e15d839c74859153cc6e930b9725703a44136f48633547ae942308d4a33b4f", "ja": "おはよう、真美。……あいさつとしては何も問題ないが\n一応聞くぞ。どうしたんだ？", "zh": "早上好，真美。……作为问候倒是没什么问题，\n不过我还是要问一下。怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0333_1005_012mam", "source_sha256": "c01d028556f6158deda1b2f8707c2b5bb61ebc1874d1bcdac245f48e2fc38258", "ja": "よくぞ聞いてくれました！　真美、この衣装を着たら\nスッキリさわやかリフレッシュな気分になったのです！", "zh": "问得好！真美穿上这套服装后，\n感觉整个人都神清气爽焕然一新了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0333_1006_p", "source_sha256": "17719d08f0e739aad1de9c98bbfda1b2cb6bc38c3df06cd6ce552eeeafcac33a", "ja": "リフレッシュ……ああ、この衣装が\n『フレッシュチャイナ』だからか？", "zh": "焕然一新……啊，是因为这套服装叫『清新旗袍』吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0333_1007_012mam", "source_sha256": "b2f7d3cdde1164503eb0c83d56ea504f2bbd8880d38302bf1624af990b5f4c58", "ja": "そうそう！　今の真美はまさにピッチピチ！\n釣りたてシンセン！　13歳は若返った気持ちだよ～！", "zh": "对对！现在的真美简直水灵灵的！刚钓上来的，新鲜得很！感觉自己年轻了13岁哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0333_1008_p", "source_sha256": "9494ec29930f280e483cd944684a98c2387e654c5d896da495d9210f7f140aaf", "ja": "13歳若返ったらフレッシュどころじゃないけどな……\nま、元気があるのはいいことだ。", "zh": "年轻13岁的话，可就不只是朝气蓬勃那么简单了啊……\n不过，有活力总是好事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0333_1009_012mam", "source_sha256": "8189c8d95d5f226e16a563240e3efe58cbe71169167621605d7322395abc4957", "ja": "うん！　だから今日は真美、初心にびゅーんと戻って、\nチョー新人な気持ちでフレッシュに頑張るかんね♪", "zh": "嗯！所以今天真美要一口气回到初心，\n抱着超级新人的心态，清清爽爽地加油啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0333_1010_012mam", "source_sha256": "936599d04d0d11449c910c4098174e009f0834cffa77666f82e12c71a574cd03", "ja": "兄ちゃんが望むなら、このピッチピチバディで\nノーサツカンフーを披露してあげてもいいんだよ？", "zh": "哥哥想看的话，真美也可以用这副青春洋溢的身材，给你表演一下迷倒人的功夫哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0333_1011_p", "source_sha256": "e0caf23fbd5dc5d41d93dac50644b4969e4de80b0507b7e17f0b1158b0bd22b3", "ja": "カンフーは遠慮しておこうかな……。とりあえず今日は\n楽しく中華街をめぐってきてくれればそれでいいから。", "zh": "功夫就先免了吧……总之，今天你们只要开心地逛逛中华街就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0333_1012_012mam", "source_sha256": "0a488bca28674302dcf20ea0c114d3478008d90230ccd5c23f6396384c518048", "ja": "えー、楽しく中華街めぐりするだけ？　\n別にフレッシュ～って感じ、しなくない？", "zh": "诶——只是开开心心逛中华街？  \n总觉得这样没什么新鲜感吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0333_1013_p", "source_sha256": "f52a098ec43ee262ac48bbfb04cd29c308cc87b31364f6f325799b90cb9c82a4", "ja": "初心に戻るって言っても、真美が元気いっぱいなのは\n新人のころから変わらないからな。", "zh": "虽说要回归初心，但真美从新人时期开始就一直活力满满，这点可没变啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0333_1014_p", "source_sha256": "462cd02038c1b31531f08f3aa0ec09459278be4942d2478b3534cc093452e939", "ja": "今回はそんな真美に似合うと思って選んだ衣装だし、\nいつも通りに楽しんでくれれば、それでバッチリだよ。", "zh": "这次选的服装，我觉得很适合这样的真美；只要像平时一样尽情享受，就完全没问题了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0333_1015_012mam", "source_sha256": "c51ef728c054dee73b4818438cfdd4302f5d83b5a2821a55282cc9858d380b0d", "ja": "そっか……兄ちゃんの気持ちはよくわかったよ……！\n兄ちゃんは、そのままの真美が大好きってことだね！", "zh": "这样啊……哥哥的心意，真美明白了……！\n也就是说，哥哥最喜欢原本的真美，对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0333_1016_p", "source_sha256": "6f52d78d914ffa0604ee7be92c8ff8ce609b30f2e045fbe31535d520dd93fb1b", "ja": "うん……？　うん、まぁそうだな！\nいつも元気で可愛い真美の姿を、存分に見せてくれ！", "zh": "嗯……？嗯，也算没说错吧！\n尽情展现平时充满元气又可爱的真美吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0333_1017_012mam", "source_sha256": "53aaf19563c8e3079f2b2e1298a8117e092da8581fde738c5de40b992a9d60d4", "ja": "仕方ないな～。兄ちゃんがそこまで言うなら\n真美も期待に応えちゃおっかな～！", "zh": "真拿你没办法～。既然哥哥都说到这份上了，真美也来回应一下期待吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0333_1018_012mam", "source_sha256": "d7eeb7ce7a9cc3991314f42e3c56d844b73816fc9c3376e2a7864bedc6d45110", "ja": "実は真美、今日行きたいお店いっぱいあったんだー！\nまず肉まんは外せないっしょ？　あと小籠包と……。", "zh": "其实真美今天有好多想去的店呢——！\n首先肉包绝对不能少吧？然后是小笼包，还有……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0333_1019_012mam", "source_sha256": "b869794584a2d2d435422576523026b60cc32c3886e06b4c51d20bc5599b6abf", "ja": "うあうあ～！　行きたいお店ゼンブ行くには\n時間が足りないっぽいよ！　早く行こ行こ、兄ちゃん☆", "zh": "哇啊哇啊～！想去的店全都去一遍的话，\n时间好像不太够用呢！快走快走，哥哥☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
